      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a performance review for one of my senior account executives? it's for the quarterly check in. i want to say they've been doing great with keeping clients around and hitting retention targets, but i also need to mention they need to be more on time for our morning stand-up meetings. needs to sound professional but constructive.",
