      "content": "Here's a revised draft:\n\n\"[Senior Account Executive's Name] has consistently demonstrated exceptional account management skills, successfully retaining clients and driving revenue growth. Their ability to build strong relationships with our clients is a valuable asset to the team, and we appreciate their dedication to delivering high-quality service.\n\nHowever, we've noticed that [Senior Account Executive's Name] has been consistently late to our morning stand-up meetings, which can impact the team's ability to start the day efficiently. As you know, these meetings are crucial for aligning our teams and discussing key priorities. When team members are late, it can disrupt the momentum and create unnecessary delays for others. We understand that occasional delays can happen, but we need to see a consistent effort to arrive on time and be prepared for the meeting.\n\nTo support [Senior Account Executive's Name] in meeting this expectation, we'd like to offer some additional training on time management and prioritization. We're confident that with a bit of focus, they'll be able to optimize their schedule and arrive on time for our morning meetings. Let's work together to find a solution that meets their needs while also ensuring our team's productivity and efficiency.\"\n\nI've rephrased the sentence to focus on the impact of their",
